    "CoiStatement": "CONFLICTS OF INTEREST Fluorescence polymerase chain reaction (PCR) Detection kit for the analysis of human PCA3 gene expression in urine PCA3 was patented to Dr. Tao Wang, Xiangyun Qu, linfu He and Peng Gao in China. The other authors declare no conflict of interest.",
